AETHER — Authors and Attribution
================================

This file records the people and organizations responsible for this project.
It is deliberately short. Only contributors whose work is part of this
repository, and who have agreed to be listed, belong here.

Project owner / maintainer
--------------------------

  Zelvior (Zelvior Labs)
  https://github.com/zelvior

Maintainer of this repository. The current governance arrangement is described
in docs/GOVERNANCE.md.

Contributors
------------

  (none listed yet)

Contributors are added with their agreement, normally once a contribution has
been merged. Being credited is optional; a contributor may ask to be left out
or to be listed under a different name.

If you believe you should be listed here and are not, or if an entry is
inaccurate, please open an issue.

How not to use this file
------------------------

Do not add names, affiliations, or contact details for other people without
their permission. Do not add organizations that have not contributed. A person
appearing in a dependency's copyright notice is not a contributor to AETHER.

Attribution for third-party material belongs in the NOTICE file, not here.
